-- src:156 | Nếu tử vong xảy ra do kết quả trực tiếp hay gián tiếp của
-- src:157 | một trong các nguyên nhân sau:
-- src:158 | (i) Phạm tội hoặc cố tình phạm tội hình sự; hoặc
-- src:159 | (ii) Bất kỳ sự tử vong nào do liên quan đến Hội chứng suy
-- src:160 | giảm miễn dịch mắc phải (AIDS) và tình trạng hoặc
-- src:161 | bệnh tật nào liên quan đến AIDS (ARC), hoặc nhiễm vi
-- src:162 | rút (virus) gây suy giảm miễn dịch ở người (HIV).
@ref Article 3.2 (src 155-162)
GIVEN `the claim` IS A `A death claim`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Article 3.2 — the death is excluded:` `the claim` MEANS
        "(i)"  ... `the claim`'s `caused directly or indirectly by an offence of the Life Insured`
    OR  "(ii)" ... `the claim`'s `related to AIDS, ARC or HIV infection`

-- src:163 | Công ty sẽ không thanh toán quyền lợi tử vong nêu tại
-- src:164 | điều 3.1 và thay vào đó Công ty sẽ chi trả:
-- src:165 | i) Giá trị hoàn lại được xác định vào Ngày định giá kế
-- src:166 | tiếp sau ngày Công ty nhận được yêu cầu giải quyết
-- src:167 | quyền lợi bảo hiểm, trừ đi
-- src:168 | ii) Các khoản Nợ phí (nếu có).
@ref Article 3.2 (src 163-168)
GIVEN `the claim` IS A `A death claim`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`Article 3.2 — the surrender value paid instead, on` `the claim` MEANS
          `the surrender value on` `the valuation after the claim date`     -- i)
    MINUS `the valuation after the claim date`'s `premium debt`             -- ii)
    WHERE
        `the valuation after the claim date` MEANS
            `the valuation on the next Valuation Date after` (`the claim`'s `date the Company received the complete and valid claim`) `among` (`the claim`'s `valuations after the death`)

§§ `3.3 Loyalty bonus`

-- At the end of the 15th policy anniversary year, if the contract is in force, the bonus
-- is allocated to the funds in proportion to their account values at that time, as units
-- at the bid price on the next Valuation Date after the 15th policy anniversary. "the end
-- of the 15th policy anniversary year" and "the 15th policy anniversary" are read as one
-- day, the 15th anniversary of the Effective Date (NOTES.md fork register).
-- src:143 | 3.3
-- src:169 | Thưởng duy trì hợp đồng
-- src:170 | Vào cuối Năm kỷ niệm hợp đồng lần thứ 15 nếu Hợp
-- src:171 | đồng vẫn còn hiệu lực, khoản Thưởng duy trì hợp đồng
-- src:172 | sẽ phân bổ vào các Quỹ theo tỷ lệ tương ứng căn cứ
-- src:173 | vào giá trị tài khoản của các Quỹ tại thời điểm thưởng.
-- src:174 | Thưởng sẽ được tính ra đơn vị Quỹ theo Giá mua được
-- src:175 | xác định vào Ngày định giá kế tiếp sau Ngày kỷ niệm
-- src:176 | Hợp đồng thứ 15. Hợp đồng phải thỏa mãn đầy đủ các
-- src:177 | điều kiện sau:
@ref Article 3.3 (src 170-176)
GIVEN `the effective date` IS A DATE
GIVETH A DATE
`Article 3.3 — the 15th policy anniversary of a contract effective on` `the effective date` MEANS
    `the policy anniversary number` 15 `of a contract effective on` `the effective date`

-- The five conditions, all of which must hold. The fourth: at no time before the 15th
-- anniversary may the withdrawals so far exceed the top-up premiums paid so far; it is
-- tested at each withdrawal, counting everything up to and including that day.
-- src:178 | - Phí Bảo hiểm Cơ bản Định kỳ được đóng đầy đủ qua
-- src:179 | các năm.
-- src:180 | - Hợp đồng chưa bao giờ bị chấm dứt như mô tả
-- src:181 | trong điều 20.
-- src:182 | - Hợp đồng chưa bao giờ trong tình trạng tạm ngưng
-- src:183 | đóng phí.
-- src:184 | - Tổng của tất cả những lần rút giá trị Tài khoản của
-- src:185 | Quỹ không vượt quá tổng của Phí bảo hiểm đóng
-- src:186 | thêm đã trả tính đến thời điểm rút, tại bất kỳ thời
-- src:187 | điểm nào trước năm kỷ niệm Hợp đồng lần thứ 15.
-- src:188 | - Hợp đồng chưa bao giờ giảm số tiền bảo hiểm trước
-- src:189 | khi trả thưởng.
GIVEN `the day`        IS A DATE
      `the movements`  IS A LIST OF `A movement of the account value`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`the top-ups paid up to` `the day` `among` `the movements` MEANS
    sum (map (GIVEN m YIELD CONSIDER m
                            WHEN `a top-up premium paid` d a          THEN IF d AT MOST `the day` THEN a ELSE 0
                            WHEN `a withdrawal of account value` d a  THEN 0)
             `the movements`)

GIVEN `the day`        IS A DATE
      `the movements`  IS A LIST OF `A movement of the account value`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`the withdrawals up to` `the day` `among` `the movements` MEANS
    sum (map (GIVEN m YIELD CONSIDER m
                            WHEN `a top-up premium paid` d a          THEN 0
                            WHEN `a withdrawal of account value` d a  THEN IF d AT MOST `the day` THEN a ELSE 0)
             `the movements`)

@ref Article 3.3, fourth condition (src 184-187)
GIVEN `the movements`        IS A LIST OF `A movement of the account value`
      `the 15th anniversary` IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Article 3.3 — the withdrawals never exceeded the top-ups, among` `the movements` `, before` `the 15th anniversary` MEANS
    all (GIVEN m YIELD CONSIDER m
                       WHEN `a top-up premium paid` d a         THEN TRUE
                       WHEN `a withdrawal of account value` d a THEN
                            IF   d LESS THAN `the 15th anniversary`
                            THEN `the withdrawals up to` d `among` `the movements` AT MOST `the top-ups paid up to` d `among` `the movements`
                            ELSE TRUE)
        `the movements`

@ref Article 3.3 (src 170-189)
GIVEN `the facts` IS A `The facts for the loyalty bonus`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Article 3.3 — the loyalty bonus is payable on` `the facts` MEANS
        `the facts`'s `in force at the 15th policy anniversary`
    ... "-" ... `the facts`'s `every regular basic premium paid in full over the years`
    ... "-" ... NOT (`the facts`'s `ever ended as Article 20 describes`)
    ... "-" ... NOT (`the facts`'s `ever on a premium holiday`)
    ... "-" ... `Article 3.3 — the withdrawals never exceeded the top-ups, among` (`the facts`'s `top-ups and withdrawals`) `, before` `the 15th anniversary`
    AND "-" ... NOT (`the facts`'s `sum assured ever reduced before the bonus`)
    WHERE
        `the 15th anniversary` MEANS
            `Article 3.3 — the 15th policy anniversary of a contract effective on` (`the facts`'s `the schedule at issue`'s `effective date`)

-- The units the bonus buys in each fund: the bonus (Article 1: 360% of the annualised
-- regular basic premium at issue), shared by account value, at each fund's bid price, on
-- the next Valuation Date after the 15th anniversary.
@ref Article 3.3 (src 171-176); Article 1 (src 103-105); Article 11.3 ii (src 450-451)
GIVEN `the facts` IS A `The facts for the loyalty bonus`
GIVETH A LIST OF `A change in units`
`Article 3.3 — the units of loyalty bonus on` `the facts` MEANS
    map (GIVEN h YIELD `A change in units` WITH
                           `fund`        IS h's `fund`
                           `reason`      IS `a loyalty bonus`
                           `units added` IS `the bonus` TIMES `the account value of` h
                                              DIVIDED BY `the total account value of` (`the valuation`'s `holdings`)
                                              DIVIDED BY h's `bid price`)
        (`the valuation`'s `holdings`)
    WHERE
        `the bonus`     MEANS `the loyalty bonus for` (`the facts`'s `the schedule at issue`)
        `the valuation` MEANS
            `the valuation on the next Valuation Date after`
                (`Article 3.3 — the 15th policy anniversary of a contract effective on` (`the facts`'s `the schedule at issue`'s `effective date`))
                `among` (`the facts`'s `valuations`)

§ `What a death claim pays`

-- The question a beneficiary asks, answered in the order the Articles decide it:
--   not in force at the death (Articles 3.1 and 20)          -> nothing;
--   claim made after the Article 18 time limit                -> nothing yet;
--   the Company avoids the contract under Article 7          -> the Article 7 refund;
--   the true age was outside the insurable ages (Article 6)  -> the Article 6 payment;
--   suicide within the two years (Article 8)                 -> the Article 8 refund;
--   excluded under Article 3.2                               -> the 3.2 surrender value;
--   otherwise                                                -> the 3.1 death benefit,
--                                                               less any charges unpaid in a grace period (9.4).
-- Where two of these overlap (a suicide within two years that is also an offence, say),
-- the earlier row governs; NOTES.md fork register says why the rows are in this order.

@ref Article 18 (src 753-761)
GIVEN `the claim` IS A `A death claim`
GIVETH A `A claim for a benefit`
`the Article 18 claim in` `the claim` MEANS
    `A claim for a benefit` WITH
        `date of the insured event`                         IS `the claim`'s `date of death`
        `date the claim was made`                           IS `the claim`'s `date the claim was first made`
        `days of force majeure or other objective obstacle` IS `the claim`'s `days of force majeure or other objective obstacle`
        `date the Policyholder learned of the event, if the Policyholder proves not knowing of it`
                                                            IS `the claim`'s `date the Policyholder learned of the death, if the Policyholder proves not knowing of it`

@ref Article 7 (src 234-262)
GIVEN `the claim` IS A `A death claim`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`the Company has avoided the contract under Article 7 on` `the claim` MEANS
    CONSIDER `the claim`'s `a non-disclosure`
    WHEN NOTHING THEN FALSE
    WHEN JUST n  THEN
        CONSIDER n's `the Company's decision date`
        WHEN NOTHING THEN FALSE
        WHEN JUST d  THEN
                `Article 7 — a ground to treat the contract as void is` n
            AND NOT (`Article 7 — the Company may no longer contest` n `on` d
                        `, for a contract issued on` (`the claim`'s `the schedule`'s `issue date`)
                        `, last reinstated` (`the claim`'s `the history`'s `date of the latest reinstatement`)
                        `, the Life Insured dying` (JUST (`the claim`'s `date of death`)))

-- Reached only after `the Company has avoided the contract under Article 7 on` is TRUE,
-- which needs both a non-disclosure and a decision date; the refusal marks the arm that
-- cannot be reached rather than pricing it at zero.
GIVEN a IS A TYPE
GIVETH AN a
`the claim records no decision under Article 7` MEANS
    REFUSE "the claim records no decision under Article 7"

@ref Article 7 (src 243-253)
GIVEN `the claim` IS A `A death claim`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`the Article 7 refund on` `the claim` MEANS
    CONSIDER `the claim`'s `a non-disclosure`
    WHEN NOTHING THEN `the claim records no decision under Article 7`
    WHEN JUST n  THEN
        CONSIDER n's `the Company's decision date`
        WHEN NOTHING THEN `the claim records no decision under Article 7`
        WHEN JUST d  THEN `Article 7 — the refund on avoidance decided on` d `, having collected` (`the claim`'s `the charges collected`) `, among` (`the claim`'s `valuations after the death`)

@ref Article 6 (src 214-225)
GIVEN `the claim` IS A `A death claim`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`the true age was outside the insurable ages on` `the claim` MEANS
    CONSIDER `the claim`'s `a misstatement of age or sex`
    WHEN NOTHING THEN FALSE
    WHEN JUST m  THEN `Article 6 —` m `puts the true Age outside the insurable ages, the contract being issued on` (`the claim`'s `the schedule`'s `issue date`)

GIVEN a IS A TYPE
GIVETH AN a
`the claim records no misstatement of age or sex` MEANS
    REFUSE "the claim records no misstatement of age or sex"

@ref Article 6 (src 214-225)
GIVEN `the claim` IS A `A death claim`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`the Article 6 payment on` `the claim` MEANS
    CONSIDER `the claim`'s `a misstatement of age or sex`
    WHEN NOTHING THEN `the claim records no misstatement of age or sex`
    WHEN JUST m  THEN `Article 6 — the payment for` m `, effective from` (`the claim`'s `the schedule`'s `effective date`) `, having collected` (`the claim`'s `the charges collected`) `, among` (`the claim`'s `valuations after the death`)

@ref Article 3 (src 132-168); Articles 6, 7, 8, 9.4, 18 and 20
GIVEN `the claim` IS A `A death claim`
GIVETH A `The payment on a death`
`what the Company pays on` `the claim` MEANS
    BRANCH
      IF NOT (`Article 20 — the contract is in force on` (`the claim`'s `date of death`) `under` (`the claim`'s `the schedule`) `, for` (`the claim`'s `the Life Insured`) `, with` (`the claim`'s `the history`))
         THEN `nothing, because the contract was not in force at the death`
      IF NOT (`Article 18 — the claim was made in time:` (`the Article 18 claim in` `the claim`))
         THEN `nothing, because the claim was made after the Article 18 time limit`
      IF `the Company has avoided the contract under Article 7 on` `the claim`
         THEN `the refund on avoidance under Article 7` (`the Article 7 refund on` `the claim`)
      IF `the true age was outside the insurable ages on` `the claim`
         THEN `the payment under Article 6` (`the Article 6 payment on` `the claim`)
      IF     `the claim`'s `suicide`
         AND `Article 8 — a suicide on` (`the claim`'s `date of death`) `falls within the two years, for a contract issued on` (`the claim`'s `the schedule`'s `issue date`) `and last reinstated` (`the claim`'s `the history`'s `date of the latest reinstatement`)
         THEN `the refund under Article 8` (`Article 8 — the refund on a suicide on` (`the claim`'s `date of death`) `, having collected` (`the claim`'s `the charges collected`) `, among` (`the claim`'s `valuations after the death`))
      IF `Article 3.2 — the death is excluded:` `the claim`
         THEN `the surrender value under Article 3.2` (`Article 3.2 — the surrender value paid instead, on` `the claim`)
      OTHERWISE `the death benefit under Article 3.1`
                    (`Article 9.4 — a benefit of` (`Article 3.1 — the death benefit on` `the claim`) `paid in a grace period, less unpaid charges of` (`the claim`'s `unpaid charges of a grace period`))
